{{Term/Store|Cane Sugar|Cane Sugars|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Cane Sugar is a [[Material]] that [[Link]] can purchase from [[The Slippery Falcon]], the [[Goron Gusto Shop]], the [[General Shoppe]], and the travelling [[Merchant]] [[Yammo]]. At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], Cane Sugar is an ingredient that can be used to make [[Green Dye]]. When Cane Sugar is boiled, it becomes a sweet juice that can be used to make cake.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

